<title>USA: American Express declines comment on shrs.</title>
<headline>American Express declines comment on shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Tuesday that American Express Co declined to comment on unusual market activity or rumors that have pushed the stock three points higher.</p>
<p>American Express shares closed at 54-7/8 after touching a high of 56 during the day. Total share volume totaled 2.35 millon shares Tuesday.</p>
<p>American Express earlier announced a credit card deal with National Westminster Bank Plc.</p>
